Script:

<cmd+space><delay=500>safari<enter><delay=900><cmd+l><delay=50>https://github.com/RoboticWorx/PolyCast5<enter>

Explanation:

This script will automatically search for the PolyCast5 GitHub repository online for iPhone.

Steps:
- Opens global search ('cmd' is same as 'win')
- Waits 500ms for it to open
- Types "safari"
- Opens safari browser
- Waits 900ms for it to open
- Selects the active search bar
- Waits 50ms for it to select
- Types PolyCast5 GitHub URL into the browser
- Hits enter